# Fixture: map_found_colony start (France 1599). Cheat rows that only change runtime/debug state, nothing in the save (all must leave it byte-identical):
# Shift-F2 Debug Info Flags (@OPTIONS checkbox list, DS:0x894 mask: Space ticks a row, Return confirms, Escape cancels),
# Shift-F8 Show Strategy, Shift-F9 Show Colony Sites (overlay toggles, press again to clear), Shift-F10 Test Routine (unit/colony counts in the status line).
# Ends with cheat mode off again (Alt-W).
key w alt
key i alt
key n alt
key F2 shift
shot
key space                # tick "Anger & Friction Levels"
key Down
key space                # tick "Indian AI movement"
shot
key Return               # confirm
key F2 shift
shot                     # both rows still ticked
key Escape               # cancel without change
key F8 shift             # Show Strategy on
wait 20
shot
key F9 shift             # Show Colony Sites on
wait 20
shot
key F10 shift            # Test Routine
shot
key F8 shift             # strategy overlay off
key F9 shift             # colony sites overlay off
wait 20
shot
key w alt
